{"key":"provider","type":"string","constraints":"one of `xiaomi` | `openai` | `deepseek` | `opencode-go`","default":"`xiaomi` (first provider-table entry)","overrides":"`--provider` (or `provider/` in `--model`) > config `provider` > default; `TAU_ENDPOINT` overrides the endpoint URL only","description":"Active provider name — selects the API endpoint and default model. TAU_ENDPOINT overrides the endpoint.","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/config.md"}
